  "workedSolution": "1. $1 - 0.9^n > 0.99 \\Rightarrow 0.9^n < 0.01 \\Rightarrow n > \\frac{\\ln 0.01}{\\ln 0.9} = 43.7$. Check: $1 - 0.9^{43} = 0.9892$ and $1 - 0.9^{44} = 0.9903$. Least $n = 44$. (43 rounds down instead of up.)",
  "hints": [
